  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v3.0.0 - One crossing per call: arguments, POCOs, arrays and results travel in a per-instance call tape in .NET memory, read by Javascript in a single JSImport. Callback arguments reach .NET memory before the call. POCO codecs are generated at compile time (SpawnDev.SpawnJS.Generators ships in this package; [SpawnJSPoco] for runtime-only types). Breaking for custom marshallers only: the contract is Write(JSTape, T) / Schema / Read(ref JSTapeReader) - NetToJS is gone. See CHANGELOG.md.",
